  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-智能投放与优化工具\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"该接口用于查询投放账户的在投计划配额和使用进度。详细说明，见 [在投计划配额介绍文档](https://bytedance.feishu.cn/docx/doxcnIgDvxYHbTcGCU1xu2KD6LO)，授权 access_token 可通过 [【获取Access token】](https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940) 接口获取，返回码和返回信息详见 [【附录-返回码】](https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831)。\",\"id\":\"ad.tools.quota.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/quota/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1731070251873293\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权 access_token 才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1731070251873293\",\"title\":\"查询在投计划配额\"}",
